Dear Customer,

We appreciate your interest in our services.

We're pleased to inform you that we accept various forms of payment, including:

- credit cards;
- cryptocurrency of various types;
- debit cards;
- pre-paid cards;
- Visa gift card that can provide online payments.

We accept cards from the following companies: Visa, Mastercard, American Express and Discover.

If you encounter any issues or have further questions during the payment process, please do not hesitate to let us know. We are here to assist you.

Best regards,
Victoria Davis

Dear Customer,

Kindly be aware that your previous correspondences did not furnish all the necessary details required to locate your subscription.

Ensure you provide us with the COMPLETE set of information outlined below, without any omissions:

The last four digits of the credit card used for the purchase;

First and last name of the credit card holder;

Amount charged;

Date of the charge;

Billing description as it appears on your statement;

Attach the payment receipt/confirmation.

Upon receipt of all the specified information, we will be better equipped to provide you with the necessary assistance.
